@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 250
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #E6E6FA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEFECE

participant "Host (Player A)" as Host
participant "Client (Player B)" as Client

== Phase 1: Host Advertising (Beacon) ==
note over Host: **State:** Lobby (Advertising)\n**Session:** 0xA (Generated Randomly)\n**Grid:** 8x8

note over Client: **State:** Scanning\nListening for Beacons...

loop Every 1-2 Seconds (Until Joined)
    Host ->] : **MSG_ADVERTISE** [Addr: Broadcast(0) | Data: Sess(0xA)]
    note left: "Game 0xA available!"
end

Client -> Client: **Receive Beacon**\nFound Game: Session 0xA

note over Client: User selects "Join Game A"

Client -> Host: **MSG_JOIN_REQ** [Sess:0xA | Data: ProtocolVer]
activate Host

Host -> Host: Client found!\n**Stop Advertising.**

Host -> Client: **MSG_WELCOME** [Sess:0xA | Data: GridSize(8)]
deactivate Host

Client -> Client: **State:** Joined\nLock Session to 0xA

== Phase 2: Map Sync (Setup) ==
note over Host: Host generates Mine Map.

loop Sync Mines (Reliable ARQ)
    Host -> Client: **MSG_SYNC_MINE** [Sess:0xA | Data:(X,Y)]
    Client -> Client: Mark Mine at (X,Y)
    Client --> Host: **MSG_ACK**
end

Host -> Client: **MSG_SYNC_DONE** [Sess:0xA]
Client --> Host: **MSG_ACK**

note over Host: **State:** MY_TURN\n(UI Unlocked)
note over Client: **State:** WAITING\n(UI Locked)

== Phase 3: Turn-Based Gameplay ==

loop Game Loop
    group Host Turn
        Host -> Host: User clicks (1,1)
        Host -> Host: Update Local Screen.\n**Set State: WAITING**

        Host -> Client: **MSG_MOVE** [Sess:0xA | Data: (1,1)]
        activate Client

        Client -> Client: 1. Receive (1,1)\n2. Update Screen\n3. **Set State: MY_TURN**
        note right: Client UI Unlocks.\n"YOUR TURN"

        Client --> Host: **MSG_ACK**
        deactivate Client
    end

    |||

    group Client Turn
        Client -> Client: User clicks (2,2)
        Client -> Client: Update Local Screen.\n**Set State: WAITING**

        Client -> Host: **MSG_MOVE** [Sess:0xA | Data: (2,2)]
        activate Host

        Host -> Host: 1. Receive (2,2)\n2. Update Screen\n3. **Set State: MY_TURN**
        note left: Host UI Unlocks.\n"YOUR TURN"

        Host --> Client: **MSG_ACK**
        deactivate Host
    end
end

== Phase 4: Game Over ==

group Fatal Move
    note over Host: **State:** MY_TURN
    Host -> Host: User clicks (3,3) -> **MINE!**
    Host -> Host: **Display: "YOU LOST"**

    Host -> Client: **MSG_GAME_OVER** [Sess:0xA | Data: Opponent_Won]

    Client -> Client: **Display: "YOU WON"**
    Client --> Host: **MSG_ACK**
end

@enduml